# CAD Design

## 📌 Overview

This folder contains the CAD modelling and design documentation of the **Smart Irrigation Monitoring System** prototype.

The CAD model represents the physical arrangement and overall structure of the developed irrigation system.

---

## 📐 CAD Views

The CAD documentation includes the following views:

- Isometric View
- Top View
- Front View
- Right-Side View

---

## 🧩 CAD Model

The 3D CAD model is used to represent the prototype arrangement and visualize the positioning of the system components.

The CAD documentation helps in understanding the overall structure and layout of the Smart Irrigation Monitoring System.

